### Filter mismatch — expected 200, no request to the listener
POST {{proxyUrl}}/wh?refMatch=v*.*.*&forwardMethod=POST&forwardUrl={{targetUrl}}/listener/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push

{
  "ref": "refs/heads/main"
}

### Target error — listener responds with 503, proxy responds with 500
POST {{proxyUrl}}/wh?refMatch=v*.*.*&forwardMethod=POST&forwardUrl={{targetUrl}}/listener/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push
X-Set-Response-Status-Code: 503

{
  "ref": "refs/tags/v0.12.1"
}
